WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,410
It bothered me for several days

2
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:13,970
The elusive Ejingteng Lake

3
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,930
He actually appeared in front of us like this

4
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,490
It’s really a great way to decipher the secrets of evil.

5
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,810
Get all the salary, comrades

6
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:21,170
Do you know this bucket you got?

7
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:22,550
what is it

8
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,230
This is called Ejingteng Lake

9
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:27,640
Foreigners call him seafood from hell

10
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,120
I didn't expect a fisherman

11
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,120
I actually know this comrade and that comrade

12
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:33,040
Come over to Tenghu with this bucket of goosejing

13
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,280
I want to sell it to Fuchang Hotel

14
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,440
I risked my life today

15
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,960
I got some Western Han goods from the rocks.

16
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:39,860
I wanted to sell it to Fuchang Hotel, but I didn’t expect this reputation.

17
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,340
It is the most upscale hotel in Huanghai County

18
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,500
He actually engages in discrimination

19
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,740
Look at my shabby clothes

20
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,140
Just let me go

21
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:48,060
Can they recruit such a contemptuous security guard and want to come to their hotel?

22
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:51,520
Not a good place either

23
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,560
That being the case

24
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,720
I just threw this thing away

25
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:58,870
Don't sell it to hotel owners either.

26
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:00,310
we don't know

27
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:01,230
don't know what

28
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:02,190
I didn’t know he was here to sell goods.

29
00:01:02,190 --> 00:01:03,430
Still don’t know the rules I set

30
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:04,390
How many times have I told you

31
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:05,670
Let's open the door and do business

32
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:07,510
What matters is the harmonious style

33
00:01:07,510 --> 00:01:08,990
You guys look down on others like this

34
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:10,070
It was me, Jin Zhilong, who was ruined

35
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:13,020
Go with the reputation of Fuchang Hotel

36
00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:14,300
Call me the manager

37
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:18,380
Don't look for me

38
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:19,700
These two can go home.

39
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:22,590
Unlock their wages boss

40
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:23,510
we know we were wrong

41
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:29,040
Give us another chance, let's go

42
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:32,600
Follow me to the finance department to collect your salary and go to the public notice.

43
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:35,160
You goose policeman has taken care of me. Please give me a precept.
